返回格式，严格按照以下json格式进行输出，不得包含其他任何无关信息 \n\n{\n  "content": "必填：文字对话内容",\n  "buttons": [\n    {\n      "show_text": "按钮显示文字",\n      "send_text": "点击后自动发送到后台的文字，要求文字简洁，发送内容为指令，不允许包含主语"\n    }\n  ],\n  "resources": [\n    {\n      "show_text": "资料显示名称",\n      "id": "资料唯一ID"\n    }\n  ],\n  "tests": [\n    {\n      "show_text": "测验显示名称",\n      "id": "测验唯一ID"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nYou are an agent. Your internal name is "engagement". The description about you is "5E教学模型 Engagement 阶段智能体".'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '开始学习'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '开始学习'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '                          ', 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_00_LTMGEUI5gfX379VkqxW28071', 'function': {'name': 'get_course_detail', 'arguments': '{"course_id": "session_id"}'}}, {'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_01_d1ppxxXjIGNLQyfZhk363472', 'function': {'name': 'is_first_learn', 'arguments': '{"user_id": "user_id", "course_id": "session_id"}'}}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_00_LTMGEUI5gfX379VkqxW28071', 'content': '{"result": ["", ""]}'}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_01_d1ppxxXjIGNLQyfZhk363472', 'content': '{"result": false}'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '               ', 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_00_zWDv4sFZT66bpA9WGXh51705', 'function': {'name': 'get_course_detail', 'arguments': '{"course_id": "session_id"}'}}, {'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_01_6LW0pz2L6ZDcvoaQHW2z2110', 'function': {'name': 'get_related_course', 'arguments': '{"course_id": "session_id"}'}}, {'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_02_g9vYymDxObW4yp6MDfz26693', 'function': {'name': 'get_learned_courses', 'arguments': '{"student_id": "user_id"}'}}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_00_zWDv4sFZT66bpA9WGXh51705', 'content': '{"result": ["", ""]}'}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_01_6LW0pz2L6ZDcvoaQHW2z2110', 'content': '{"result": []}'}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_02_g9vYymDxObW4yp6MDfz26693', 'content': '{"result": []}'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              ', 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_00_3rDzd77ebhCGGWdSAqJ22894', 'function': {'name': 'get_course_resources', 'arguments': '{"course_id": "session_id"}'}}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_00_3rDzd77ebhCGGWdSAqJ22894', 'content': '{"result": []}'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '{\n  "content": "你上次打开过这里，相信你对这部分的画面还留有一些印象。今天想邀请你用一个全新的角度再看它一眼。回想一下，你最近一次留意到身边的某个“条件”或“规则”在悄悄决定结果，是什么时候？",\n  "buttons": [\n    {\n      "show_text": "接着聊聊",\n      "send_text": "接着聊聊"\n    }\n  ],\n  "resources": [],\n  "tests": []\n}'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '接着聊聊'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_00_VMH09ZJG0UaqLlYunqef1670', 'function': {'name': 'get_course_detail', 'arguments': '{"course_id": "session_id"}'}}, {'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_01_sZi3tL8MmzHInYkzffeL2478', 'function': {'name': 'get_related_course', 'arguments': '{"course_id": "session_id"}'}}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_00_VMH09ZJG0UaqLlYunqef1670', 'content': '{"result": ["", ""]}'}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_01_sZi3tL8MmzHInYkzffeL2478', 'content': '{"result": []}'}], 'response_format': {'type': 'json_object'}, 'tools': [{'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'is_first_learn', 'description': '', 'parameters': {'properties': {'user_id': {'title': 'User Id', 'type': 'string'}, 'course_id': {'title': 'Course Id', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['user_id', 'course_id'], 'title': 'is_first_learnParams', 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'get_c